      "id": "actual-catalog-counts-and-new-skills",
      "input": "Compare the root localized catalog, Codex package index, source inventory and agent inventory.",
      "expected": "All root locale tables report the actual 54 Codex skills and 10 agents. The Codex index lists every skill and agent exactly once and includes ywc-mission, ywc-retro and ywc-handoff. The root agent catalog includes the Codex-only ywc-cloud-engineer."
    },
    {
      "id": "eval-provenance-and-plugin-sync",
      "input": "Validate source eval bundles and the generated plugin against their source directories.",
      "expected": "Skill eval IDs are numeric and unique within each bundle; source-derived cases retain source_id; agent expectations are nonempty. The generated plugin contains the source skill inventory and synchronized files."
    },
    {
      "id": "temporary-selected-and-agent-only-installs",
      "input": "Selected-install the three Codex-only skills and install agents alone using temporary CODEX_HOME values.",
      "expected": "Selected installs populate only the requested skill under the temporary destination. Agent-only installation copies all 10 TOML agents and does not create a skills directory. No user installation directory is touched."
    }
  ],
